Feature: One parametrization exercise spans two matrices and one complete sixteen-type graph
  The language-neutral v18 fixture specifies one shared parametrization for sixteen canonical
  Metabolism types, two nine-by-nine matrices and a three-page reading order.
  mathjs independently evaluates numeric transformations, cycle sums and sixteen times fifteen.
  Categorical Form changes compose endpoint replacements without category arithmetic.
  d3-array independently constructs all ordered nonreflexive vertex pairs and the Cartesian matrix cells.
  Its seeded shuffle independently reproduces the four edges of one selected inner cycle.
  ajv validates the versioned schema. A separate lxml XML oracle verifies each original SVG.
  None of these references reads the document implementation.

